", "Relaxed", "Heart racing", "Shaky", "Sweaty", "Normal"]}}}, {"role": "user", "payload": {"text": "Relaxed"}}, {"role": "assistant", "payload": {"messages": ["**Hati:** What are you feeling?"], "message": "**Hati:** What are you feeling?", "ui": {"type": "buttons", "options": ["Anxious", "Neutral", "Calm", "Irritable", "Scared"]}}}, {"role": "user", "payload": {"text": "Anxious"}}, {"role": "assistant", "payload": {"messages": ["**Hati:** What do you notice first?"], "message": "**Hati:** What do you notice first?", "ui": {"type": "buttons", "options": ["Professor's stern face", "The other student", "The cluttered desk", "The exit door"]}}}, {"role": "user", "payload": {"text": "Professor's stern face"}}, {"role": "assistant", "payload": {"messages": ["**Hati:** That's great. Calm is a resource. Let's see if we can keep it as we go.", "**Hati:** The other student is almost done. In a moment, you'll need to approach the professor. Let's prepare a simple script so you don't have to think on the spot.", "**Hati:** What do you need to say? Here's a basic template. You can use it or make your own:"], "message": "**Hati:** That's great. Calm is a resource. Let's see if we can keep it as we go.", "ui": {"type": "buttons", "options": ["Good morning, Professor. I need your signature on this class requirement form.", "Excuse me, Professor. Could you please sign this form? It's for a class requirement.", "I'll type my own line"]}}}, {"role": "user", "payload": {"text": "Excuse me, Professor. Could you please sign this form? It's for a class requirement."}}, {"role": "assistant", "payload": {"messages": ["**Hati:** Good. You have your line. Now let's also prepare for possible questions. The professor might ask:", "\"What's this for?\"", "\"What class is this for?\"", "\"Why do you need this signed?\"", "**Hati:** How would you answer one of those? For example 'What's this for?' Answer it on a short sentence."], "message": "**Hati:** Good. You have your line. Now let's also pr