**Hati:** You're standing at the front of the room. Five professors are watching you.", "**Hati:** Let me introduce them: Professor 1 (Dr. Reyes) \u2013 Middle, neutral expression, taking notes. Professor 2 (Dr. Cruz) \u2013 Stern-looking, arms crossed. Professor 3 (Dr. Santos) \u2013 Appears supportive, slight nod. Professor 4 (Dr. Garcia) \u2013 Silent, staring at laptop. Professor 5 (Dr. Lopez) \u2013 Older, seems tired but attentive.", "**Hati:** They're taking notes. Some have neutral expressions, some look stern. The room is quiet. You're about to present the objectives of your project.", "**Hati:** Before you begin, let's do a Physical, Intellectual, Emotional, and Social check.", "**Hati:** How does your body feel?"], "message": "**Hati:** You're standing at the front of the room. Five professors are watching you.", "ui": {"type": "buttons", "options": ["Tense", "Heart racing", "Shaky", "Sweaty", "Dry mouth", "Normal"]}}}]}, "0e701471-893f-46f0-8d43-1b715d1b2b66": {"step": "scene7_dashboard", "data": {"theme": "Fear of Being Observed & Performing", "scenario_key": "fbop_spotlight", "user_name": "there", "emotion": "neutral", "pies_physical": "Heart racing", "pies_emotional": "Irritable", "pies_environmental": "Professors staring", "fbop_title": "HATI", "fbop_opening_pick": "Use option A (formal)", "fbop_contrib": "Beca", "fbop_goal_pick": "Speak the first sentence without stopping", "goal_text": "Speak the first sentence without stopping", "fbop_ground": "Hand on chest: notice your heartbeat", "fbop_delivery": "HEllo", "story_branch": "confident", "fbop_o_phase": 3, "fbop_significance_answer": "DAWD", "fbop_limitation_answer": "DAWD", "predicted_anxiety": 10, "actual_anxiety": 10, "bad_happened": "Yes", "bad_detail": "awd", "credit": "awd", "last_coping_tool": "**Hati:** Anchor: recall a time you succeeded in a performance\u2014you still have that capability.", "coping_try": "Maybe later"}, "history": [{"role": "assistant", "payload": {"messages": ["**Hati:** Hi, there. Today's scenario is a big one: presenting your project objectives to a thesis panel. This is a classic performance situation. The fear is real, but you can practice handling it. I'll be right here with you."], "message": "**Hati:** Hi, there. Today's scenario is a big one: presenting your project objectives to a thesis panel. This is a classic performance situation. The fear is real, but you can practice handling it. I'll be right here with you.", "ui": {"type": "buttons", "options": ["Begin"]}}}, {"role": "user", "payload": {"text": "Begin"}}, {"role": "assistant", "payload": {"messages": ["**Hati:** You're standing at the front of the room. Five professors are watching you.", "**Hati:** Let me introduce them: Professor 1 (Dr. Reyes) \u2013 Middle, neutral expression, taking notes. Professor 2 (Dr. Cruz) \u2013 Stern-looking, arms crossed. Professor 3 (Dr. Santos) \u2013 Appears supportive, slight nod. Professor 4 (Dr. Garcia) \u2013 Silent, staring at laptop. Professor 5 (Dr. Lopez) \u2013 Older, seems tired but attentive.", "**Hati:** They're taking notes. Some have neutral expressions, some look stern. The room is quiet. You're about to present the objectives of your project.", "**Hati:** Before you begin, let's do a Physical, Intellectual, Emotional, and Social check.", "**Hati:** How does your body feel?"], "message": "**Hati:** You're standing at the front of the room. Five professors are watching you.", "ui": {"type": "buttons", "options": ["Tense", "Heart racing", "Shaky", "Sweaty", "Dry mouth", "Normal"]}}}, {"role": "user", "payload": {"text": "Heart racing"}}, {"role": "assistant", "payload": {"messages": ["**Hati:** What are you feeling?"], "message": "**Hati:** What are you feeling?", "ui": {"type": "buttons", "options": ["Anxious", "Scared", "Neutral", "Calm", "Irritable", "Overwhelmed"]}}}, {"role": "user", "payload": {"text": "Irritable"}}, {"role": "assistant", "payload": {"messages": ["**Hati:** What do you notice first?"], "message":