ati:** They're taking notes. Some have neutral expressions, some look stern. The room is quiet. You're about to present the objectives of your project.", "**Hati:** Before you begin, let's do a Physical, Intellectual, Emotional, and Social check.", "**Hati:** How does your body feel?"], "message": "**Hati:** You're standing at the front of the room. Five professors are watching you.", "ui": {"type": "buttons", "options": ["Tense", "Heart racing", "Shaky", "Sweaty", "Dry mouth", "Normal"]}}}, {"role": "user", "payload": {"text": "Heart racing"}}, {"role": "assistant", "payload": {"messages": ["**Hati:** What are you feeling?"], "message": "**Hati:** What are you feeling?", "ui": {"type": "buttons", "options": ["Anxious", "Scared", "Neutral", "Calm", "Irritable", "Overwhelmed"]}}}, {"role": "user", "payload": {"text": "Anxious"}}, {"role": "assistant", "payload": {"messages": ["**Hati:** What do you notice first?"], "message": "**Hati:** What do you notice first?", "ui": {"type": "buttons", "options": ["Professors staring", "The clock", "Your notes", "The exit door", "The podium"]}}}, {"role": "user", "payload": {"text": "The clock"}}, {"role": "assistant", "payload": {"messages": ["**Hati:** I notice you selected Heart racing. That's completely normal when facing something important. Your body is preparing for something meaningful. Let's work with that energy.", "**Hati:** First, what is the title of your project? Type it below (even a short version is fine)."], "message": "**Hati:** I notice you selected Heart racing. That's completely normal when facing something important. Your body is preparing for something meaningful. Let's work with that energy.", "ui": {"type": "text_input", "placeholder": "Project title..."}}}]}, "cc203564-0803-4d14-82a8-35ec0e3674f8": {"step": "pies_physical", "data": {"theme": "Fear of Strangers & New People", "scenario_key": "fsn_seat", "user_name": "there", "emotion": "neutral"}, "history": [{"role": "assistant", "payload": {"messages": 