eath. When you're ready, approach the table."], "message": "**Hati:** Good. Keep that goal. Take a breath. When you're ready, approach the table.", "ui": {"type": "buttons", "options": ["Approach"]}}}, {"role": "user", "payload": {"text": "Approach"}}, {"role": "assistant", "payload": {"messages": ["**Narrator:** You walk toward the shared table. The stranger looks up briefly, removes one earbud.", "**Stranger:** Oh, hey. Need a seat?"], "message": "**Narrator:** You walk toward the shared table. The stranger looks up briefly, removes one earbud.", "ui": {"type": "text_input", "placeholder": "What you say to the stranger..."}}}, {"role": "user", "payload": {"audio": true, "transcript": "you", "audio_emotion": "disgust", "text_emotion": "neutral"}}, {"role": "assistant", "payload": {"messages": ["**Stranger:** (shakes head, returns to laptop) No, it's free.", "**Hati:** See? That was simple. You asked, they answered. Now just say 'Thanks' and sit down."], "message": "**Stranger:** (shakes head, returns to laptop) No, it's free.", "ui": {"type": "buttons", "options": ["Thanks", "Sit down without speaking"]}}}, {"role": "user", "payload": {"text": "Thanks"}}, {"role": "assistant", "payload": {"messages": ["**Stranger:** (no further interaction, continues working)", "**Hati:** Perfect. You did it. You're sitting. Notice how your body feels now compared to before."], "message": "**Stranger:** (no further interaction, continues working)", "ui": {"type": "buttons", "options": ["Continue"]}}}, {"role": "user", "payload": {"text": "Continue"}}, {"role": "assistant", "payload": {"messages": ["**Hati:** The scenario is over now, so let\u2019s take a moment to reflect on what happened.", "**Hati:** Let's pause and reflect. You just did something that feels scary to many people, approaching a stranger in public. No matter how it went, you showed up.", "**Hati:** Let's compare what you **predicted** with what **actually** happened."], "message": "**Hati:** The scenario is over no