ppen?"], "message": "**Hati:** Did anything bad actually happen?", "ui": {"type": "buttons", "options": ["Yes", "No"]}}}, {"role": "user", "payload": {"text": "No"}}, {"role": "assistant", "payload": {"messages": ["**Hati:** What's one small thing you can give yourself credit for?"], "message": "**Hati:** What's one small thing you can give yourself credit for?", "ui": {"type": "text_input", "placeholder": "Type your response..."}}}, {"role": "user", "payload": {"text": "aw"}}, {"role": "assistant", "payload": {"messages": ["**Hati:** Look at that\u2014your **actual** anxiety was lower than you **predicted**. Your brain predicted **danger**, but **reality** was manageable. That's evidence you can use next time."], "message": "**Hati:** Look at that\u2014your **actual** anxiety was lower than you **predicted**. Your brain predicted **danger**, but **reality** was manageable. That's evidence you can use next time.", "ui": {"type": "buttons", "options": ["Continue"]}}}, {"role": "user", "payload": {"text": "Continue"}}, {"role": "assistant", "payload": {"messages": ["**Hati:** Based on what you experienced, here's a tool you can use next time:", "**Hati:** Anchor to routine: same script as ordering coffee\u2014simple script, simple response.", "**Hati:** Do you want to try this by yourself now?"], "message": "**Hati:** Based on what you experienced, here's a tool you can use next time:", "ui": {"type": "buttons", "options": ["Yes", "Maybe later", "No"]}}}, {"role": "user", "payload": {"text": "Maybe later"}}, {"role": "assistant", "payload": {"messages": ["**Hati:** Here's what I want you to remember:", "**Hati:** Most strangers are neutral and busy. Asking for a seat is ordinary\u2014not a performance.Small talk is a skill\u2014you practiced turning nerves into connection.", "**Hati:** You showed up today. That's a win. I'll be here next time."], "message": "**Hati:** Here's what I want you to remember:", "ui": {"type": "buttons", "options": ["Finish"]}}}, {"role": "u