rm.", "Excuse me, Professor. Could you please sign this form? It's for a class requirement.", "I'll type my own line"]}}}, {"role": "user", "payload": {"text": "Good morning, Professor. I need your signature on this class requirement form."}}, {"role": "assistant", "payload": {"messages": ["**Hati:** Good. You have your line. Now let's also prepare for possible questions. The professor might ask:", "\"What's this for?\"", "\"What class is this for?\"", "\"Why do you need this signed?\"", "**Hati:** How would you answer one of those? For example 'What's this for?' Answer it on a short sentence."], "message": "**Hati:** Good. You have your line. Now let's also prepare for possible questions. The professor might ask:", "ui": {"type": "text_input", "placeholder": "Your brief answer..."}}}, {"role": "user", "payload": {"text": "aw"}}, {"role": "assistant", "payload": {"messages": ["**Hati:** Perfect. You don't need a perfect answer, just something honest. Remember: you're not asking for a favor; this is a standard process. The professor signs forms like this all the time.", "**Hati:** Take a breath. Ready?"], "message": "**Hati:** Perfect. You don't need a perfect answer, just something honest. Remember: you're not asking for a favor; this is a standard process. The professor signs forms like this all the time.", "ui": {"type": "buttons", "options": ["Approach"]}}}, {"role": "user", "payload": {"text": "Approach"}}, {"role": "assistant", "payload": {"messages": ["**Narrator:** The other student leaves. The professor looks up at you.", "**Professor:** Yes? What is it?"], "message": "**Narrator:** The other student leaves. The professor looks up at you.", "ui": {"type": "text_input", "placeholder": "What you say to the professor..."}}}, {"role": "user", "payload": {"text": "Yes"}}, {"role": "assistant", "payload": {"messages": ["**Narrator:** The professor takes your form and glances at it.", "**Professor:** Hmm. What's your form about?", "**Hati:** Answer briefly\u2014you