. You have your line. Now let's also prepare for possible questions. The professor might ask:", "ui": {"type": "text_input", "placeholder": "Your brief answer..."}}}, {"role": "user", "payload": {"text": "For our project"}}, {"role": "assistant", "payload": {"messages": ["**Hati:** Perfect. You don't need a perfect answer, just something honest. Remember: you're not asking for a favor; this is a standard process. The professor signs forms like this all the time.", "**Hati:** Take a breath. Ready?"], "message": "**Hati:** Perfect. You don't need a perfect answer, just something honest. Remember: you're not asking for a favor; this is a standard process. The professor signs forms like this all the time.", "ui": {"type": "buttons", "options": ["Approach"]}}}, {"role": "user", "payload": {"text": "Approach"}}, {"role": "assistant", "payload": {"messages": ["**Narrator:** The other student leaves. The professor looks up at you.", "**Professor:** Yes? What is it?"], "message": "**Narrator:** The other student leaves. The professor looks up at you.", "ui": {"type": "text_input", "placeholder": "What you say to the professor..."}}}, {"role": "user", "payload": {"text": "Good morning professor, I would like to ask you to sign my papers for our project"}}, {"role": "assistant", "payload": {"messages": ["**Narrator:** The professor takes your form and glances at it.", "**Professor:** Hmm. What's your form about?", "**Hati:** Answer briefly\u2014you prepared for this."], "message": "**Narrator:** The professor takes your form and glances at it.", "ui": {"type": "text_input", "placeholder": "Your answer in a sentence or two..."}}}, {"role": "user", "payload": {"audio": true, "transcript": "you", "audio_emotion": "disgust", "text_emotion": "neutral"}}, {"role": "assistant", "payload": {"messages": ["**Professor:** Fine. Make sure you have ethics approval. Next.", "**Hati:** See? That was straightforward. You did exactly what you needed to. Notice how your body feels now compared 